        "severity": "CRITICAL",
        "location": "Architecture-level issue",
        "abstract_state": {
          "required_state": "ValidationStatus per block root",
          "required_values": "{PENDING, GOSSIP_VALIDATED, STATE_TRANSITION_PASSED, GOSSIP_FAILED, STATE_TRANSITION_FAILED}",
          "actual_state": "No tracking mechanism identified"
        },
        "issue": "The codebase lacks a mechanism to track and query the validation status of blocks. AvailableBlocks only checks existence. There is no equivalent HasValidatedBlock() or GetBlockValidationStatus() that the RPC handler could use to enforce the property requirement.",
        "architectural_gap": "The database schema and BeaconDB interface do not expose validation state, making it impossible for the RPC handler to implement the required check without major architectural changes."
      },
      {
        "anomaly_type": "UNBOUNDED_MALICIOUS_REQUEST_SPACE",
        "severity": "MEDIUM",
